@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:申请费用调整与</u>\n<u>退费控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:应收账目</u>" as Bill
participant "<u>:患者资金</u>" as Funds
participant "<u>:费用申请</u>" as Request
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-24办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-24办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
opt 费用申请涉及账目
K -> Bill : 提供原费用依据(原账目及执行)
activate Bill
Bill --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Bill
end
K -> Funds : 核对可申请范围(原付款、未决事项)
activate Funds
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
K -> Request : 提出费用处理(患者、原单、临床核实与拟处理\n额)
activate Request
Request -> Request : 保留申请版本(提交人、原因与所据版本)
Request --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Request
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Request
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
